// Marion County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search and The Marion Star) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The July "OSU Marion" link was actually the OSU Extension office; the campus
//     (osumarion.osu.edu) and Extension are now listed separately.
//   * The Harding Presidential Sites are on the Ohio History Connection's site
//     (hardingpresidentialsites.org redirects there).
//   * United Way of Marion is now United Way of North Central Ohio.
//   * The county links the Municipal Court with a typo (marionmuncipalcourt.org);
//     the correct marionmunicipalcourt.org is listed.
//   * The ADAMH board moved to cmadamhoh.gov.
//   * The Auditor's property search is Pivot Point.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Marion County IN (Indianapolis), FL (Ocala), OR, IL, IA and others; Marion IN/IL/
//   IA/VA; the Marion Kiwanis site in search results is Marion, Illinois; Caledonia
//   MN/MI; Prospect KY; Waldo FL/ME; Marion Catholic High School closed in 2013.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Marion, the seat). Seven villages (LaRue has its own site; the others
//     use county-hosted pages); townships use county roster pages except Bowling
//     Green and Richland.
//   * Five school districts (Marion City, Elgin, Pleasant, Ridgedale, River Valley),
//     the North Central Ohio ESC, Tri-Rivers Career Center, and Ohio State Marion and
//     Marion Technical College on a shared campus.
//   * OhioHealth Marion General Hospital; Center Street Community Health Center;
//     the Crawford-Marion ADAMH Board.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * The Marion and North Central correctional institutions (state prisons).
//   * caledoniaoh.gov (never names the village), the airport, Pleasant Township's own
//     site, the Tallgrass Trail page and EXPLORE-IT-TORIUM: not verified.
//   * Humane society, Marion Area Counseling Center, fire districts, CIC/port
//     authority and food pantries: no own website found. Private clubs and mini golf.

